{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This demo is its own unique, separate chapter that won't be part of the full game!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape the Beach: Chapter Zero</strong>\u00a0is a short, absurdist walking sim where your one and only objective is clear: you have to escape the beach. You can expect:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >traversable beach environment with full day/night cycle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >short story mode (15-20 minutes)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >fully voiced narrator that guides you through the experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >many bizarre objects that appear on the beach</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >multiple-choice questions with branching dialogue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >replay value: explore objects and narrative options you missed on your first playthrough</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Wishlist the game to be notified when it releases!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929210/extras/eaeb180a474d3814d942715819ca5044.poster.avif?t=1755494517\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929210/extras/eaeb180a474d3814d942715819ca5044.webm?t=1755494517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929210/extras/eaeb180a474d3814d942715819ca5044.mp4?t=1755494517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3929210?t=1755494517","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3929210?t=1755494517","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3